<p>The peace that you have been looking for is found in <strong>the here and Now.</strong></p>
<p>Everything that you have ever lived and done, seen, worked for and lost has led you to being here <strong>right here and now.</strong></p>
<p>How beautiful.</p>
<p>If you understand this, you will know you have <strong>bliss within your grasp</strong>.</p>
<p>You need not die and go to the Kingdom of Heaven.  You are within it right <strong>Now</strong>.</p>
<p><em>“The Kingdom of God is Within You” - Luke 17&lt;21&gt;</em></p>
<p>All it takes is realizing that you can find Heaven anywhere, anytime. It doesn’t have to be on some Mountaintop, or in some Ocean, or in the Arms of some lovely figure. It could be in sitting in silence. In doing the dishes. In watching your child smile. In being fully, relentlessly <strong>Present</strong>.</p>
<p>It is within you.</p>
<p>And all around you.</p>
<p>Seek no more. You have found.  Go forever forward knowing that you don’t have to die to get to Heaven.</p>
<p>You can live it everyday, everywhere, and for the rest of your life.</p>